Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n2,"Check if process has started in Admin Office") -> action(n3,"Proceed to verify completeness of invoices") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"the process should be continued.") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"Mark relevant box on invoice entry form") -> action(n8,"Check if process has been completed") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n10,"Proceed to verify completeness of invoices") -> end(e2)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"Check if process has started in Admin Office") -> action(n3,"Proceed to verify completeness of invoices") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"Return uncompleted invoices to client via postal mail") -> action(n6,"Receive completed invoices from client") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"Mark relevant box on invoice entry form") -> action(n8,"Check if process has been completed") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n10,"Proceed to verify completeness of invoices") -> end(e2)